# Rendered AVSpeech audio for scripts/check_dictation_readings.py — ~37k clips,
# reproducible from the corpus, not source.
.dictation-wav/

# Agent scratch, and it is NOT cosmetic that this is here.
#
# Sessions leave full worktrees under `.claude/worktrees/`, each with its OWN `Package.swift`.
# STATE-2026-08-18 records what that costs: four of them totalled 1.5 GB and every release build
# rsync'd all of it, and — worse — `xcodebuild -list` STALLS at 0% CPU on a second Swift package
# nested under the root package's directory. It was never tracked, but nothing stopped it: this
# directory was absent from .gitignore while several sessions ran `git add -A` in this tree.
# One `git add -A` during a fan-out would have committed a gigabyte and a build stall together.
/.claude/
